    "description": {
      "value": "A bound guardian is a tattoo guardian bonded to your skin, which you can temporarily animate to protect you. If your soul leaves your body, your tattoo guardian might be destroyed (see the sidebar, Bestiary 3 262).\n\n- **Activate:** 3 Actions\n- **Traits:** conjuration\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou animate your tattoo guardian, otherwise using the duration and other parameters of a 4th-level summon construct spell. You can have the guardian Fly Free as part of Activating your tattoo.\n\nIf your tattoo guardian drops to 0 HP, the activation ends, and the inanimate tattoo returns to your skin."
